{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): Howzit. Doctor Naidoo's rooms, ja. You're early actually, the N1 was crawling from that Marlboro robot.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0003] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): You catch the Proteas last night?",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0005] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): Ag shame, half of Joburg missed it and the other half is cross. They were a hundred and eighty for four at the Wanderers, batting lekker, then the Highveld storm just sat on the ground.",
  "[SEG0006] person_2 (PATIENT): Right.",
  "[SEG0007] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): My brother-in-law had seats on the side. He's been on the family WhatsApp since sunrise about the covers, the lost beer money, the whole match washed out. Proper sulk.",
  "[SEG0008] person_2 (PATIENT): Shame.",
  "[SEG0009] person_3 (NURSE): Come through, Mr Pillay. Shoes off for the scale, please.",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (PATIENT): Ok.",
  "[SEG0011] person_3 (NURSE): Blood pressure is one thirty two over eighty four. Pulse 76. Shoes back on.",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (PATIENT): Thanks.",
  "[SEG0013] person_3 (NURSE): Any allergies to medicine?",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0015] person_3 (NURSE): Sharp. Sorry if I yawn, hey. My sister's little boy has had croup all week and I was up half the night with her, steaming the bathroom.",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (PATIENT): Ok.",
  "[SEG0017] person_3 (NURSE): Doctor will be in now-now. He's fighting with that computer again.",
  "[SEG0018] person_4 (DOCTOR): Sorry, sorry. Umm, the file froze. You're mister... say that again?",
  "[SEG0019] person_2 (PATIENT): Pillay.",
  "[SEG0020] person_4 (DOCTOR): Mr Pillay. What brings you in?",
  "[SEG0021] person_2 (PATIENT): Licence.",
  "[SEG0022] person_4 (DOCTOR): The driving licence. Hold on, I'm opening the epilepsy note. Still taking the levetirasetam?",
  "[SEG0023] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0024] person_4 (DOCTOR): Umm. Dose? The screen jumped.",
  "[SEG0025] person_2 (PATIENT): Five hundred.",
  "[SEG0026] person_4 (DOCTOR): Sorry, say again. Five hundred what?",
  "[SEG0027] person_2 (PATIENT): Milligrams.",
  "[SEG0028] person_4 (DOCTOR): How often?",
  "[SEG0029] person_2 (PATIENT): Twice.",
  "[SEG0030] person_4 (DOCTOR): So levetiracetam 500 milligrams twice a day, by mouth. That right?",
  "[SEG0031] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0032] person_4 (DOCTOR): Any big convulsive seizures, the shaking ones, in the last two years?",
  "[SEG0033] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0034] person_4 (DOCTOR): File says the Epilim, the sodium valproate, was stopped two years ago. Correct?",
  "[SEG0035] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0036] person_4 (DOCTOR): Umm, your wife phoned the rooms. Blank spell last month, she reckoned. True?",
  "[SEG0037] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0038] person_4 (DOCTOR): Bite your tongue with it?",
  "[SEG0039] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0040] person_4 (DOCTOR): Wet yourself?",
  "[SEG0041] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0042] person_4 (DOCTOR): Umm, headache after?",
  "[SEG0043] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0044] person_4 (DOCTOR): And the tablets, every dose?",
  "[SEG0045] person_2 (PATIENT): Missed some.",
  "[SEG0046] person_4 (DOCTOR): Say again? This fan is loud.",
  "[SEG0047] person_2 (PATIENT): Travelling. Missed.",
  "[SEG0048] person_4 (DOCTOR): Eish. When you skip the levetiracetam the amount in the blood falls and the brain cells can fire in little bursts again. That blank stare is the brain switching off for a moment. I'm thinking this may have been a small breakthrough seizure, though I can't be certain.",
  "[SEG0049] person_2 (PATIENT): Ok.",
  "[SEG0050] person_4 (DOCTOR): Don't drive for now, hey. And don't skip doses when you travel. I've put through a blood test for the levetiracetam level. Come back in two weeks for the result.",
  "[SEG0051] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): Lab downstairs is booked for Thursday, half seven. No need to fast.",
  "[SEG0052] person_2 (PATIENT): Sharp."
 ],
